# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RentX — Environment Variables Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE:
#   1. Copy this file to .env.local in the same folder:
#        Windows PowerShell:  Copy-Item .env.local.example .env.local
#        macOS / Linux:       cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
#   2. Open .env.local and replace every placeholder value with your real values.
#
#   3. Restart the dev server so Vite picks up the new values:
#        npm run dev
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
#   • .env.local is listed in .gitignore — it will NEVER be committed to Git.
#   • This .env.local.example file contains NO real secrets — it IS committed.
#   • Only paste the "anon / public" key below, NEVER the service-role key.
#   • The service-role key bypasses Row Level Security; it must only live in
#     secure server-side code (Supabase Edge Functions or a backend server).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase Connection ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# WHERE TO FIND THESE VALUES:
#   → Log in to https://supabase.com/dashboard
#   → Open your project
#   → Go to: Project Settings → API
#   → Copy "Project URL" into VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#   → Copy "anon / public" key into VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
#      (it starts with "eyJ..." and is safe to use in browser code)
#
# FORMAT: https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# The anon/public API key (safe for browser — respects Row Level Security)
# DO NOT paste the service_role key here under any circumstances.
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Phase 6 — Razorpay Payment Gateway (Test Mode / Production)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Find these in Razorpay Dashboard → Settings → API Keys → Generate Key:
# VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID is safe for the browser (public identifier, e.g. rzp_test_...).
VITE_RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_yourKeyIdHere

# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET is strictly server-side (DO NOT prefix with VITE_).
# Used exclusively by the server to sign and verify payment HMAC signatures.
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=your_razorpay_key_secret_here
